---

This project defines a constrained profile of CriticMarkup
(http://criticmarkup.com/), created by Gabe Weatherhead, Erik Hess,
Martin Fenner, and contributors. The mark syntax originates there;
this project adds an optional identifier extension and specifies
anchoring, patching, and response semantics on top of it.
